      374.33
    ],
    "text": "High Court Judge of Colombo dated 23.3.2021.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      76.58,
      397.13,
      538.05,
      410.09
    ],
    "text": "In the instant application the Counsel appearing for the petitioner stated that the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      76.58,
      420.89,
      361.08,
      433.85
    ],
    "text": "exceptional circumstances he is urging are as follows,",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      94.58,
      442.78,
      518.9,
      457.75
    ],
    "text": "1) The B reports filed by the investigative officers do not carry a synopsis of the",
    "fonts": [
      "ArialMT",
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      94.58,
      463.03,
      535.9,
      548.95
    ],
    "text": "evidence for the magistrate to consider before remanding the suspects which is a violation of section 115 (1) 0f the Code of Criminal Procedure Code Act no 15 of 1978.(hereinafter referred to as the CPC) 2) The petitioner was not physically present inside the boat which was taken in to",
    "fonts": [
      "ArialMT",
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      112.58,
      554.23,
      160.03,
      567.19
    ],
    "text": "custody.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      76.58,
      584.59,
      538.12,
      597.55
    ],
    "text": "The position of the respondents is that on a tip off received by the Police Narcotics",
